{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/632668698cf4ef1a5bd5a9daca4a09f9.avif?t=1759592025\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul's Remnant is a free to play 2D platformer MMORPG by Chaomoon, with a focus on social gameplay and exploration. Customize your skills with our classless system, team up with others, and defeat monsters, bosses, and dungeons together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the mysterious world of Soul's Remnant with friends or meet new ones along the way\u2014just watch out when night falls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/50ef855b75d4d7e11f3bcaac054c82a7.avif?t=1759592025\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D platformer MMORPG</strong> with a cute and colorful pixel art graphics style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large world to explore</strong> with lots of monsters, bosses, dungeons, and secrets to find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classless skill system and</strong>\u00a0<strong>various stats </strong>to build your character with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>equipment</strong> of various rarities to find and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging <strong>dungeons and bosses</strong> for your (and your friends) to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild system</strong> with various perks for you and your guild to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>crafting and gathering system</strong>, with many recipes to unlock and items to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive <strong>quest system</strong> that provides various fun missions to complete for rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>player-driven and party-based content</strong>, such as parties, party grinding, housing, and player shops for a full player-driven economy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full soundtrack of 30+ originally composed songs, all written, composed, and produced by Chaomoon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/c23896e927d75bfbf929abe19ad20aa8.avif?t=1759592025\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by a small indie team!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Chaomoon! For nearly 9 years now, since April 2016, I've developed Soul's Remnant alone as my passion project. Over years of hosting public playtests, the game developed a community of dedicated players, and grew to be something larger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, working towards bigger and better versions of the game, the team has expanded, with Rajah joining the team to help with future updates and development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/ad15f69dd42e2247a5426198470e733d.avif?t=1759592025\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed with community in mind!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback has always been a crucial part of Soul's Remnant's development, so feel free to join our community and leave feedback for us, as we continuously work towards making the game even better!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451980?t=1759592025","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3451980?t=1759592025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/dfd0da1e7e3da81893c53d87e2e2905c03e54c56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759592025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/dfd0da1e7e3da81893c53d87e2e2905c03e54c56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759592025","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/632668698cf4ef1a5bd5a9daca4a09f9.avif?t=1759592025\" width=624 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul's Remnant is a free to play 2D platformer MMORPG by Chaomoon, with a focus on social gameplay and exploration. Customize your skills with our classless system, team up with others, and defeat monsters, bosses, and dungeons together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the mysterious world of Soul's Remnant with friends or meet new ones along the way\u2014just watch out when night falls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/50ef855b75d4d7e11f3bcaac054c82a7.avif?t=1759592025\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D platformer MMORPG</strong> with a cute and colorful pixel art graphics style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large world to explore</strong> with lots of monsters, bosses, dungeons, and secrets to find!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classless skill system and</strong>\u00a0<strong>various stats </strong>to build your character with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>equipment</strong> of various rarities to find and upgrade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging <strong>dungeons and bosses</strong> for your (and your friends) to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild system</strong> with various perks for you and your guild to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full <strong>crafting and gathering system</strong>, with many recipes to unlock and items to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comprehensive <strong>quest system</strong> that provides various fun missions to complete for rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>player-driven and party-based content</strong>, such as parties, party grinding, housing, and player shops for a full player-driven economy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full soundtrack of 30+ originally composed songs, all written, composed, and produced by Chaomoon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/c23896e927d75bfbf929abe19ad20aa8.avif?t=1759592025\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by a small indie team!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Chaomoon! For nearly 9 years now, since April 2016, I've developed Soul's Remnant alone as my passion project. Over years of hosting public playtests, the game developed a community of dedicated players, and grew to be something larger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, working towards bigger and better versions of the game, the team has expanded, with Rajah joining the team to help with future updates and development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/extras/ad15f69dd42e2247a5426198470e733d.avif?t=1759592025\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed with community in mind!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback has always been a crucial part of Soul's Remnant's development, so feel free to join our community and leave feedback for us, as we continuously work towards making the game even better!</p>","developers":["Chaomoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451980/header.jpg?t=1759592025","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3451980/1098851545/72a502a6a7ecc4192b5273b73db3029625c7610c/1759587566/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759592024","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3451980/1098851545/72a502a6a7ecc4192b5273b73db3029625c7610c/1759587566/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759592024","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3451980/1098851545/72a502a6a7ecc4192b5273b73db3029625c7610c/1759587566/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759592024","id":257211977,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257211977/movie48